#: internal/modules/account/settings.go:170
msgid "Username must be 3-20 characters, letters and numbers only."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງມີ 3-20 ຕົວອັກສອນ, ສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຕົວເລກ."

#: internal/modules/account/settings.go:178
