"Service is restarting. This may indicate a configuration error or a crash — "
"check the logs on the Services page."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການກຳລັງຣີສະຕາດ. ນີ້ອາດສະແດງເຖິງຂໍ້ຜິດພາດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ຫຼື ການລົ້ມ — "
"ກວດເບິ່ງບັນທຶກໃນໜ້າບໍລິການ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:48 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:203
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:65
msgid "Service is paused. Resume it from the Services page."
msgstr "ບໍລິການຖືກຢຸດຊົ່ວຄາວ. ສືບຕໍ່ມັນຈາກໜ້າບໍລິການ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:50 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:205
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:67
msgid ""
"Service has stopped. This is usually caused by resource exhaustion — "
"increase resource limits for this service and then restart it from the "
"Services page."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການຢຸດແລ້ວ. ປົກກະຕິເກີດຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນໝົດ — "
"ເພີ່ມຂີດຈຳກັດຊັບພະຍາກອນສຳລັບບໍລິການນີ້ ແລ້ວຣີສະຕາດຈາກໜ້າບໍລິການ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:52 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:207
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:69
msgid "Service is being deleted. Please wait for the process to complete."
msgstr "ກຳລັງລຶບບໍລິການ. ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ຂະບວນການສຳເລັດ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:54 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:209
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:71
msgid ""
"Service has crashed and cannot recover. This is usually caused by resource "
"exhaustion — check the logs on the Services page."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການລົ້ມ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຟື້ນຕົວໄດ້. ປົກກະຕິເກີດຈາກຊັບພະຍາກອນໝົດ — "
"ກວດເບິ່ງບັນທຶກໃນໜ້າບໍລິການ."

#: internal/modules/mongodb/mongodb.go:60 internal/modules/mysql/mysql.go:215
#: internal/modules/postgresql/postgresql.go:77
msgid ""
"Service is unhealthy. Try restarting it from Services, or contact your "
