#: internal/web/templates/files/backup_restore.html:689
msgid ""
"Select a backup to restore everything in it: files, databases, emails, "
"domains with their DNS zones and cron jobs."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກການສຳຮອງເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນທຸກຢ່າງໃນນັ້ນ: ໄຟລ໌, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ອີເມວ, ໂດເມນພ້ອມໂຊນ "
"DNS ແລະ ວຽກອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: internal/web/templates/files/backup_restore.html:690
msgid ""
"Select a backup to restore all its website files, or pick single files and "
"folders with Choose files."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກການສຳຮອງເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນໄຟລ໌ເວັບໄຊທ໌ທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ "
"ໂຟນເດີແຕ່ລະອັນດ້ວຍ ເລືອກໄຟລ໌."

#: internal/web/templates/files/backup_restore.html:691
msgid ""
"Select one or more databases. The newest backup is used unless you choose "
"another one."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຖານຂໍ້ມູນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນ. ຈະໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງໃໝ່ສຸດ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານເລືອກອັນອື່ນ."

#: internal/web/templates/files/backup_restore.html:692
msgid ""
"Select one or more email accounts. The newest backup is used unless you "
"choose another one."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກບັນຊີອີເມວໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍບັນຊີ. ຈະໃຊ້ການສຳຮອງໃໝ່ສຸດ "
"ເວັ້ນເສຍແຕ່ທ່ານເລືອກອັນອື່ນ."

#: internal/web/templates/files/backup_restore.html:693
msgid ""
"Select one or more domains to restore their configuration, PHP version and "
