"ຂ້ອຍຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ບລັອກສະແດງໃຫ້ທຸກຄົນເຫັນ, ລວມທັງເຄື່ອງມືຄົ້ນຫາ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:679
msgid "Pingbacks"
msgstr "Pingbacks"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:680
msgid "Enable or disable pingbacks from other websites"
msgstr "ເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດ pingbacks ຈາກເວັບໄຊທ໌ອື່ນໆ"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:685
msgid "Pingbacks and Trackbacks"
msgstr "Pingbacks ແລະ Trackbacks"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:687
msgid "Allow pingbacks and trackbacks from other blogs (default)"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ pingbacks ແລະ trackbacks ຈາກບລັອກອື່ນໆ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:697
msgid "Update Settings"
msgstr "ອັບເດດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:753
msgid "Failed to get options. Server returned status"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງຕົວເລືອກໄດ້. ເຊີບເວີສົ່ງສະຖານະກັບມາ"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:778
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:788
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:806
msgid "Shuffle Salts"
msgstr "ສຸ່ມຄ່າ Salts ໃໝ່"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:784
msgid ""
"WordPress salts are random strings stored in wp-config.php file that are "
"used for the password hashing process. By periodically changing your keys "
"and salts, you make it even harder for hackers to get their hands on your "
"salts."
msgstr ""
"WordPress salts ແມ່ນຂໍ້ຄວາມສຸ່ມທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ wp-config.php "
"ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນຂະບວນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ການປ່ຽນແປງຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປັນປະຈຳ "
"ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພຈາກການຖືກແຮັກຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:785
msgid ""
"Note: changing salts will automatically log out all logged-in users and "
"force them to log in again."
msgstr ""
"ໝາຍເຫດ: ການປ່ຽນ salts "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທັງໝົດທີ່ກຳລັງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຢູ່ຖືກອອກຈາກລະບົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ"
" ຕ້ອງເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:830
msgid "Check Integrity"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນ"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:835
msgid ""
"If you suspect that this site is infected by malware, check the integrity of"
" WordPress core files or Plugins by verifying them against their reference "
"checksums from wordpress.org."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານສົງໄສວ່າເວັບໄຊທ໌ຖືກມັລແວ (Malware) ໂຈມຕີ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WordPress ຫຼື ປລັກອິນ "
"ໂດຍການປຽບທຽບກັບຄ່າ Checksums ມາດຕະຖານຈາກ wordpress.org."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:838
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:874
msgid "Check WP Core"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WP"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:839
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:910
msgid "Check All Plugins"
msgstr "ກວດສອບປລັກອິນທັງໝົດ"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:860
msgid "Checking integrity of WP Core files... Please wait."
msgstr "ກຳລັງກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WP... ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:887
msgid "An error occurred while verifying checksums."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບ checksum."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:896
msgid "Checking integrity for all WordPress plugins... Please wait."
msgstr "ກຳລັງກວດສອບຄວາມສົມບູນຂອງປລັກອິນ WordPress ທັງໝົດ... ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:923
msgid "An error occurred while verifying plugins checksums."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການກວດສອບ checksum ຂອງປລັກອິນ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:945
msgid "Reinstall"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໃໝ່"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:950
msgid ""
"If checksums fail to match, you can quickly reinstall WordPress core files "
"or all plugins without affecting your site content."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກຄ່າ checksum ບໍ່ກົງກັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WordPress ຫຼື "
"ປລັກອິນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ເນື້ອໃນເວັບໄຊທ໌ຂອງທ່ານ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:953
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:976
msgid "Reinstall WP Core files"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WP ໃໝ່"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:954
#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:1004
msgid "Reinstall All Plugins"
msgstr "ຕິດຕັ້ງປລັກອິນທັງໝົດໃໝ່"

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:966
msgid "Downloading WP core files... Please wait."
msgstr "ກຳລັງດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ຫຼັກ WP... ກະລຸນາລໍຖ້າ."

#: internal/web/templates/manager/wp/single.html:994
