"Protect %(domain)s from attacks like SQL injection, cross-site scripting and"
" malicious bots."
msgstr ""
"ປົກປ້ອງ %(domain)s ຈາກການໂຈມຕີເຊັ່ນ SQL injection, cross-site scripting ແລະ "
"ບັອດທີ່ເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ."

